  "description": "The Revibikes Cougar is a high-performance moped-style electric motorcycle designed for power, speed, and comfort. Equipped with a robust 750W gear hub motor, it delivers strong acceleration, with 80N.m of torque (upgradable to 110N.m in the PRO version) for excellent hill-climbing ability and responsive riding.\nCougar e bikes that look like motorcycles, powered by a high-capacity 1040Wh Samsung lithium battery, the Cougar moped e bike offers an impressive 60-80 miles (96-128 km) per charge, making it ideal for long commutes or leisure rides. With a top speed of 38 MPH (61 km/h), it provides a thrilling yet stable riding experience.\nFor safety and control, it features Wesun dual hydraulic disc brakes (front & rear) for reliable stopping power, along with full front and rear suspension to absorb bumps and ensure a smooth ride on various terrains.\nStart your ride with a tap! The Cougar features NFC keyless ignition – simply hold your enabled card or smartphone near the reader for instant power-on. No more fumbling for keys; just seamless, tech-driven access paired with theft deterrence.\nCombining motorcycle-inspired styling with electric efficiency, the Revibikes Cougar is perfect for riders seeking speed, range, and comfort.",
